WEBVTT

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:13.633
Bu! Panas banget,

00:00:13.633 --> 00:00:15.600
aku buka kulkas,

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.320
wajahku adem!

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.567
Ide bagus!

00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:22.433
Pintunya dibuka,

00:00:22.433 --> 00:00:24.763
dapur tak perlu AC lagi!

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:27.833
Jangan cabut AC!

00:00:27.833 --> 00:00:30.413
Tebak: pintu terus terbuka,

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:33.963
dapur jadi sejuk atau malah panas?

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.233
Panas?

00:00:36.233 --> 00:00:38.473
Kulkas kan dingin!

00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:41.397
Dekatkan tangan ke belakang kulkas.

00:00:42.833 --> 00:00:46.133
Di situ sama sekali tak dingin.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.400
Di belakang,

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.170
ada apa, ya?

00:00:50.767 --> 00:00:54.197
Lalu kotak berdengung di balkon,

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:57.270
anginnya dingin atau panas?

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:00.900
Kotak AC

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:03.340
pasti anginnya dingin, kan?

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:07.260
Jawabannya ada di satu kulkas.

00:01:07.533 --> 00:01:11.003
Saat pintunya terbuka, panasnya ke mana?

00:01:12.333 --> 00:01:14.743
Kulkas penuh dingin,

00:01:14.767 --> 00:01:17.897
pintu dibuka, dinginnya keluar!

00:01:18.333 --> 00:01:20.253
Ingat teh panas di meja?

00:01:21.633 --> 00:01:24.003
Lama-lama jadi bagaimana?

00:01:25.033 --> 00:01:26.643
Jadi hangat.

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:28.733
Panasnya pergi

00:01:28.733 --> 00:01:30.413
Kalau es batu?

00:01:31.233 --> 00:01:32.373
Meleleh.

00:01:33.333 --> 00:01:36.913
Es meleleh karena panas
udara di sekitarnya masuk.

00:01:38.533 --> 00:01:42.313
Dengan sendirinya, panas
cuma pindah ke yang dingin.

00:01:43.933 --> 00:01:45.123
Dingin?

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:48.100
Udara dingin tak bisa pindah?

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:50.860
Dingin itu panasnya sedikit.

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:55.040
Dingin bukan benda yang kabur.

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:57.700
Lalu wajahku

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:00.133
kok jadi adem?

00:02:00.133 --> 00:02:03.363
Udara dingin keluar, menyentuh wajahmu,

00:02:04.433 --> 00:02:07.403
panas wajahmu pindah ke udara itu.

00:02:08.267 --> 00:02:10.097
Panasku dicuri!

00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:13.300
Ayo gambar satu lingkaran.

00:02:14.533 --> 00:02:17.693
Panas yang masuk atau keluar, kita catat.

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:22.680
Panas jadi bola-bola merah.

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:25.820
Mulai dari dalam kulkas.

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:30.100
Rak atas cuma 3 sampai 5 derajat,

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:32.720
jauh lebih dingin dari dapur.

00:02:33.467 --> 00:02:36.007
Freezer di bawah, tebak?

00:02:36.233 --> 00:02:40.183
Biasanya minus 18 derajat, bahkan lebih.

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:42.733
Minus 18!

00:02:42.733 --> 00:02:45.093
Lebih dingin dari musim dingin!

00:02:45.667 --> 00:02:48.607
Makin beda suhu, panas makin menyusup.

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:52.067
Panas dapur

00:02:52.067 --> 00:02:53.767
mau masuk kulkas?

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:59.050
Mau. Panas selalu pergi ke yang dingin.

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:02.020
Tapi pintunya menahan sedikit.

00:03:03.133 --> 00:03:04.803
Pegang tepi pintunya,

00:03:05.733 --> 00:03:09.553
tebal, berat, ada karet lembut di tepinya.

00:03:10.333 --> 00:03:12.973
Tebal kayak termos!

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:16.090
Ya, isinya bahan penahan panas.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:20.360
Itu insulasi: panas jadi lambat.

00:03:20.433 --> 00:03:23.603
Ingat pintu tebal ini, nanti muncul lagi.

00:03:24.967 --> 00:03:27.000
Cuma lambat?

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.760
Panas tetap masuk?

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:31.830
Ya. Tapi tetap dingin,

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:34.990
artinya ada yang membuang panas.

00:03:35.833 --> 00:03:38.123
Bola panas dikirim keluar satu-satu.

00:03:40.167 --> 00:03:41.733
Panas

00:03:41.733 --> 00:03:43.253
dibawa ke mana?

00:03:43.867 --> 00:03:46.033
Apa kulkasnya

00:03:46.033 --> 00:03:47.813
memakan panas?

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:51.670
Panas tak hilang, cuma pindah.

00:03:52.467 --> 00:03:54.887
Coba lihat belakang kulkas.

00:03:55.667 --> 00:03:57.227
Eh? Hangat!

00:03:57.867 --> 00:03:59.577
Ada angin!

00:03:59.633 --> 00:04:02.753
Dekatkan saja; ada kabel, jangan dipegang.

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:06.720
Pipa berkelok di sini terasa hangat.

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:12.767
Panas yang hilang dari dalam keluar sini.

00:04:12.767 --> 00:04:15.637
Panasnya ke belakang!

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:18.800
Ada kulkas meniup hangat dari bawah,

00:04:19.567 --> 00:04:22.007
kakimu pernah tertiup saat di depannya?

00:04:23.767 --> 00:04:25.367
Kaki anget

00:04:25.367 --> 00:04:26.937
wajah adem!

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:29.800
Kulkas tak punya tangan,

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:32.567
gimana bawa panas?

00:04:32.567 --> 00:04:35.327
Di pipanya ada sesuatu yang berputar,

00:04:36.533 --> 00:04:38.503
namanya refrigeran.

00:04:39.067 --> 00:04:40.027
Hah?

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:41.550
Itu dingin?

00:04:42.467 --> 00:04:46.657
Tak selalu, tapi bisa
berubah. Habis mandi,

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:49.380
keluar basah-basah, menggigil, kan?

00:04:50.933 --> 00:04:53.533
Iya! Air panas, lho!

00:04:53.533 --> 00:04:56.413
Air di tubuhmu menguap dan terbang,

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:59.050
membawa panas tubuhmu.

00:05:00.433 --> 00:05:03.003
Makanya basah itu dingin!

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:07.460
Di dalam kulkas, refrigeran
juga cair jadi gas,

00:05:08.333 --> 00:05:10.803
membawa panas ke dalam pipa.

00:05:12.533 --> 00:05:14.533
Sedingin itu,

00:05:14.533 --> 00:05:17.153
refrigeran bisa jadi gas?

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:21.300
Bisa. Refrigeran gampang mendidih,

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:25.880
sedikit panas kulkas cukup jadi gas.

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:28.500
Dingin kok didih?

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:30.630
Cairan yang aneh!

00:05:31.467 --> 00:05:33.433
Gas panasnya

00:05:33.433 --> 00:05:35.523
lalu ke mana?

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:38.400
Masuk ke tabung bundar.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:40.610
Tabung itu namanya kompresor.

00:05:41.667 --> 00:05:44.097
Kompresor memampatkan gas.

00:05:44.733 --> 00:05:48.093
Refrigeran yang dimampatkan
ke pipa belakang,

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:52.720
jadi cair, panasnya diberi ke dapur.

00:05:53.633 --> 00:05:56.683
Lalu kembali ke dalam, berputar lagi.

00:05:58.267 --> 00:06:00.627
Kayak kereta pembawa panas!

00:06:01.333 --> 00:06:05.823
Mirip. Berputar terus, membawa
panas dari dalam ke luar.

00:06:07.167 --> 00:06:09.827
Kereta itu perlu didorong?

00:06:10.667 --> 00:06:13.767
Listrik. Memampatkan gas itu berat,

00:06:15.067 --> 00:06:17.557
kompresor perlu listrik terus.

00:06:18.633 --> 00:06:21.863
Listrik kita gambar jadi petir kuning.

00:06:22.767 --> 00:06:26.637
Tak terus jalan: kalau hangat, ia kerja,

00:06:26.967 --> 00:06:29.400
dingin, ia rehat.

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:32.000
Pantas kadang sepi!

00:06:32.667 --> 00:06:34.197
Listriknya,

00:06:34.833 --> 00:06:37.023
akhirnya ke mana?

00:06:37.133 --> 00:06:39.800
Lalu panas belakang,

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:41.360
sama banyak

00:06:41.633 --> 00:06:43.223
dari dalam?

00:06:43.667 --> 00:06:45.967
Lingkarannya kita perbesar,

00:06:46.933 --> 00:06:49.593
seluruh dapur masuk.

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:52.790
Kulkas, belakangnya, dan kamu,

00:06:53.867 --> 00:06:56.257
sekarang dalam satu lingkaran.

00:06:58.333 --> 00:07:01.153
Pintu tutup, angka gampang:

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:04.700
kulkas membuang dua bola panas,

00:07:05.433 --> 00:07:07.483
kompresor pakai satu listrik.

00:07:08.767 --> 00:07:10.467
Keluar berapa bola?

00:07:11.133 --> 00:07:14.373
Tiga. Dua tadi, ditambah satu.

00:07:14.633 --> 00:07:17.043
Satu itu dari listrik kompresor.

00:07:18.733 --> 00:07:20.873
Yang keluar lebih banyak!

00:07:22.133 --> 00:07:26.853
Ya. Listrik tak hilang,
akhirnya jadi panas.

00:07:27.433 --> 00:07:30.903
Pintu tertutup, dapur jadi panas?

00:07:31.333 --> 00:07:37.600
Dua bola itu tadinya menyusup
lewat dinding, pintu.

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:39.780
Kini balik ke dapur,
plus satu dari listrik.

00:07:41.267 --> 00:07:43.867
Jadi meski tertutup,

00:07:43.867 --> 00:07:46.007
dapur jadi lebih panas?

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:50.980
Ya, selama kulkas jalan,
dapur sedikit lebih panas.

00:07:52.067 --> 00:07:54.100
Kalau pintu

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:55.240
kubuka?

00:07:55.633 --> 00:07:57.963
Panas dapur masuk lewat pintu,

00:07:59.133 --> 00:08:02.303
kulkas membuangnya lagi ke dapur.

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:05.470
Panasnya muter-muter!

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:09.250
Ya, dua bola itu masuk lagi lewat pintu,

00:08:10.567 --> 00:08:12.937
panas dapur tak berkurang satu pun.

00:08:14.433 --> 00:08:17.733
Tapi tiap putaran, petir

00:08:17.733 --> 00:08:19.643
menambah satu bola panas.

00:08:20.433 --> 00:08:23.393
Jadi pintu terbuka,

00:08:23.433 --> 00:08:25.943
dapur malah panas!

00:08:25.967 --> 00:08:28.667
Tapi di depan pintu

00:08:28.667 --> 00:08:30.537
memang adem!

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:33.740
Benar, di depan pintu memang sejuk.

00:08:34.767 --> 00:08:38.027
Tapi kamu pergi, sejuknya tak berguna.

00:08:39.033 --> 00:08:41.383
Dalam kulkas terus hangat,

00:08:42.267 --> 00:08:45.737
kompresor tak berhenti,
terus pakai listrik.

00:08:46.933 --> 00:08:49.413
Kasihan kulkasnya!

00:08:49.733 --> 00:08:51.623
Meteran listrik juga,

00:08:52.367 --> 00:08:54.207
tagihan ikut naik.

00:08:55.133 --> 00:08:57.603
Kulkas terbuka itu

00:08:57.933 --> 00:09:00.503
kayak pemanas ruangan?

00:09:01.033 --> 00:09:03.373
Mirip. Cuma memutar,

00:09:03.767 --> 00:09:06.147
dan isi kulkas ikut jadi hangat.

00:09:07.767 --> 00:09:10.377
Inilah tipuan kulkas:

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:14.360
ia pemindah panas, bukan pembuat dingin.

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:17.100
Aku tertipu!

00:09:17.167 --> 00:09:18.617
Kalau AC?

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:21.190
AC juga pemindah panas?

00:09:22.467 --> 00:09:25.647
Ya. AC dan kulkas mesin yang sama.

00:09:26.267 --> 00:09:30.627
Ada refrigeran, kompresor, pakai listrik.

00:09:30.667 --> 00:09:32.800
Lalu AC

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:35.050
kok bisa bikin kamar sejuk?

00:09:36.067 --> 00:09:38.867
Jawabannya di balkon. Yuk lihat ke sana.

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:43.260
Wah, anginnya panas!

00:09:43.633 --> 00:09:46.173
Ini unit outdoor. Panasnya

00:09:47.333 --> 00:09:49.923
diangkut dari dalam kamarmu.

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:53.033
Tahu! Udara luar

00:09:53.033 --> 00:09:56.967
didinginkan, ditiup!

00:09:56.967 --> 00:10:01.037
Banyak yang kira begitu. Padahal AC

00:10:01.267 --> 00:10:03.327
meniup udara kamarmu sendiri.

00:10:05.067 --> 00:10:09.487
Unit dinding sedot udara,
ambil panas, tiup balik.

00:10:10.267 --> 00:10:13.537
Ia dan unit balkon disambung dua pipa.

00:10:14.667 --> 00:10:16.647
Refrigeran berputar,

00:10:17.467 --> 00:10:20.057
mirip apa di kulkas?

00:10:20.533 --> 00:10:22.023
Kereta panas!

00:10:22.633 --> 00:10:27.253
Kini lingkari kamarmu: kamar
itu bagian dalam kulkas,

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:30.460
dan belakang kulkas di luar.

00:10:32.167 --> 00:10:34.707
Bagian panas di luar!

00:10:34.733 --> 00:10:38.323
Kini panas dibuang ke
luar, tak langsung balik,

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:42.220
panas di dalam benar-benar berkurang.

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:47.180
Listrik AC juga jadi panas,

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:50.280
ikut keluar di unit outdoor.

00:10:50.367 --> 00:10:53.267
AC biasa, 1 listrik

00:10:53.267 --> 00:10:55.437
memindah beberapa panas.

00:10:55.667 --> 00:10:58.767
Satu listrik, banyak panas?

00:10:58.767 --> 00:11:00.507
Banyak banget!

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:03.340
Tergantung AC dan cuaca,

00:11:04.333 --> 00:11:06.953
makin panas luar, makin berat.

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:09.600
Ingat pintu tebal?

00:11:10.267 --> 00:11:13.917
Saat AC nyala, kamu
tutup jendela dan tirai,

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:17.633
itu pintu tebalnya.

00:11:17.633 --> 00:11:20.400
Makanya jendela ditutup!

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:22.620
AC memindah panas keluar,

00:11:23.267 --> 00:11:25.977
insulasi bikin panas luar lambat kembali.

00:11:28.267 --> 00:11:30.667
Angkut dan tahan!

00:11:30.667 --> 00:11:32.137
Kalau jendela terbuka?

00:11:33.567 --> 00:11:36.437
Sama kayak kulkas terbuka, tak berhenti.

00:11:37.867 --> 00:11:39.700
Kamar AC

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:41.250
kulkas besar!

00:11:41.367 --> 00:11:44.807
Ya, dan kamu tinggal di dalamnya.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:48.050
Yuk balik ke dapur.
Pintunya masih terbuka.

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:51.660
Ide bagusku?

00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:54.100
Aku tarik lagi!

00:11:54.533 --> 00:11:56.283
Bagian panasnya

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:58.780
masih di dapur!

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:02.780
Kulkas dan AC mesin yang sama, kan?

00:12:03.367 --> 00:12:06.527
Bedanya: bagian panas di dalam atau luar.

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:10.900
Nanti, raba belakang kulkas:

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:15.380
Ingat tiga bola merah?
Hangat itu ya mereka.

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:18.600
Oh, begitu!

00:12:18.600 --> 00:12:20.860
Unit outdoor di mana?

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:23.860
Seberapa panas? Tulis di komentar.

00:12:24.967 --> 00:12:29.927
Yuk cari 'kenapa' sehari-hari,
subscribe Kantor Oh Begitu.
